# Daemon environment — copy to daemon/.env and fill in.
#
#   cp daemon/.env.example daemon/.env
#
# Read by scripts/dev/sheshnag-daemon-dev.service. Precedence is
# CLI > env (DAEMON_*) > config.yaml > defaults, so anything set here beats
# daemon/config.yaml. Full variable reference: docs/setup.md § Daemon.
#
# Parsed by systemd's EnvironmentFile, which is not a shell: no `export`
# prefix, no command substitution. Quote values containing spaces.

# REQUIRED. Org worker API key, created in the dashboard
# (Provider portal → API keys). The daemon exits at startup without it.
DAEMON_API_KEY=gk-your-org-worker-key

# Control plane URL. The dev unit already passes --backend-url on the command
# line, which wins over this — set it for non-systemd runs. Note the dev
# backend listens on 8005; daemon/config.yaml still defaults to 8000.
# DAEMON_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8005

# Unique worker ID. Auto-generated with a hostname prefix if omitted.
# DAEMON_WORKER_ID=my-gpu-01

# Inference runtime: ollama (default) or vllm.
# DAEMON_RUNTIME=ollama
# DAEMON_OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
# DAEMON_VLLM_URL=http://localhost:8100

# DAEMON_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
